---
id: KelolaMappingDokumenPosisi-UbahMapping
title: Kelola Mapping Dokumen Posisi - Ubah Mapping
---
%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"background": "#dddddd", "primaryColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#000000", "primaryTextColor": "#000000", "lineColor": "#000000", "textColor": "#000000", "actorBkg": "#ffffff", "actorBorder": "#000000", "actorTextColor": "#000000", "activationBkgColor": "#ffffff", "activationBorderColor": "#000000", "signalColor": "#000000", "signalTextColor": "#000000", "labelBoxBkgColor": "#ffffff", "labelBoxBorderColor": "#000000", "labelTextColor": "#000000", "sequenceNumberColor": "#000000", "noteBkgColor": "#ffffff", "noteBorderColor": "#000000", "noteTextColor": "#000000"}, "sequence": {"useMaxWidth": true, "wrap": true, "messageFontSize": 12, "noteFontSize": 12}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HR as HR/Super Admin
    participant UI as Web UI :boundary
    participant C as DocumentPositionMappingController :control
    participant DPM as DocumentPositionMapping Model :entity
    participant DB as Database :entity

    HR->>UI: Klik tombol Edit pada mapping tertentu
    UI->>C: GET /admin/document-position-mappings/{id}
    C->>+DPM: Find mapping dengan relasi
    DPM->>+DB: SELECT dpm.*, p.name as position_name, dt.name as document_name FROM ... WHERE dpm.id = ?
    DB-->>-DPM: Mapping data
    DPM-->>C: DocumentPositionMapping instance
    C-->>UI: Response dengan data
    UI->>UI: Tampilkan form dengan data terpre-fill (posisi dan dokumen biasanya read-only, hanya required flag)
    HR->>UI: Ubah required flag dan klik Simpan
    UI->>C: PUT /admin/document-position-mappings/{id}
    note over C: Validasi: posisi dan dokumen tetap sama (deduplikasi)
    alt Validasi berhasil
        C->>+DPM: Update mapping
        DPM->>+DB: UPDATE document_position_mappings SET is_required = ?, updated_at = NOW() WHERE id = ?
        DB-->>-DPM: Mapping berhasil diperbarui
        DPM-->>C: Updated instance
        C-->>UI: Response sukses
        UI-->>HR: Notifikasi perubahan berhasil
    else Validasi gagal
        C-->>UI: Response error
        UI-->>HR: Tampilkan pesan error
    end

